meta {
  name: 01-Browse listings (anonymous)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings?page=0&size=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.headers["cache-control"]: contains public
}

docs {
  Day 1, lunchtime at the office. I literally just heard about
  DreamHomes from a colleague who said it's where she found her
  place in Lekki. I'm not going to give my email yet — I just want
  to see what's even on this thing.

  I'm going to load the first page of listings. As an anonymous
  visitor with no login. If this requires me to register first,
  that's a deal-breaker — I'll close the tab.
}
